	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Siles tam diu.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid causae potest esse?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Fortassis ea, quę et me torpore ne<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scio quo degravat et tantum non opprimit, rerum inquam status tam miser.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Evangelium iam a multis annis ceptum adeo nihildum fructificat, ut <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in deterius fere labatur in dies.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scribit <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Der Brief <persName ref="p5565">Capitos</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note> <persName ref="p5250">Hofmannicos</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">die Anhänger von <persName ref="p5250">Melchior Hoffman</persName>.</note> partem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>bonam suorum occupasse.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vide incuriam pręfectorum rerumpublicarum!</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Exemplum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>possum dare: Civis est <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensis</placeName> admodum dives, interim tamen, ut <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>audio, pius; Muͤy cognomentum est<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="3">Welcher Angehörige der <persName ref="p19148">Familie Mieg</persName> gemeint ist, läßt sich nicht feststellen.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In eius ędes nuper sex illius hę<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>reseos viri absente ipso intrantes petunt ab uxore cibum, et dum hęc <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>diceret se nihil habere parati, subiiciunt: "Si soror es, cibum non recusabis."</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Ut igitur vidit, quo animo adessent, vocat vicinos.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Per hos factum, ut <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>isti denuo exirent, quamquam non multo post marito iam praesente re<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>deunt et itidem petunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Adeo impudentia prehendit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Verum etiam tum e<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>iecti sunt vacuo ventre.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Hoc nefas ecce non audio puniri.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Vagantur <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>verbi praesides interim in rebuspublicis alienis, tanquam domi nihil <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sit prorsus agendum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> hatte schon mehrfach ähnliche Kritik an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> und <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName> geäußert, vgl. oben <ref target="file10592">Nr. 556</ref>, 18-22.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Scribit idem <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName> hęc verba: "Miri rumore<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>s de novo regno externo apud <placeName ref="l20">Hollandos</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Es handelt sich wohl um Gerüchte über die Erstürmung des Rathauses von <placeName ref="l13">Amsterdam</placeName> durch Täufer am 10. Mai 1535, vgl. Wilhelmus Johannes <hi>Kühler,</hi> Geschiedenis der Nederlandsche Doopsgezinden in de zestiende eeuw, Haarlem 1932, S. 179f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Illud pro certo accepimus, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><placeName ref="l1097">Monasterienses</placeName> etiamnum se propugnare fortissime.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Caeterum quicquid de <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>anabaptistis referatur, quia deum factis suis praetendunt, tam video <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>potestates evangelicas terreri, ut manus miicere non audeant, ne <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sanguine divorum contaminentur.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ad preces video confugiendum unice <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>devotas et fideles."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="228"/>Pręter hęc audi, quod delectabit.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dixit mi<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>hi <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> quidam<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Unbekannt.</note>, affinis meus, <placeName ref="l1056">Mussensem</placeName> latronem illum abduxis<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>se furto uxorem ducis <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudiae</placeName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Das Gerücht von der Entführung <persName ref="p20784">Beatrix' von Portugal</persName> durch den Kastellan von <placeName ref="l1056">Musso</placeName> entbehrt jeder Grundlage.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Egregium nuncium profecto, si verum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Bene vale cum tuis et <persName ref="p3242">Utingero</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, 7. iunii anno 1535.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myco.</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesiastę <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
